{"id": null, "n": "0758001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0758001", "type": "mod", "text": "阿【大】，佛說阿【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0758002", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0758002", "type": "mod", "text": "天竺三藏【大】，西域沙門【宋】【元】【明】【宮】"}
